<title>USA: Wis. $68 mln hospital deal yields 6.10 pct in 2025.</title>
<headline>Wis. $68 mln hospital deal yields 6.10 pct in 2025.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co said Tuesday it tentatively priced $68 million Wisconsin Health and Educational Facilities Authority revenue bonds at a top yield of 6.10 percent in 2025.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>WISCONSIN HEALTH AND EDUCATIONAL FACILITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>$67,965,000*</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS SERIES 1996</p>
<p>GUNDERSEN CLINIC LTD AND</p>
<p>LUTHERAN HOSPITAL-LA CROSSE INC.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa</p>
<p>S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>FSA INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 9/1/1996</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: 12/1/1996</p>
<p>DUE: 12/1</p>
